d confirm. Vendor delivers to your door in 10–40 min.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="relative z-10 text-center"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg></div><div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase mb-2">Step 4</div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#0D1B40] text-lg mb-2">Confirm &amp; pay on delivery</h3><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Pay with cash or M-Pesa when your gas arrives. Give the vendor your 4-digit PIN to confirm.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="why-mobigas" class="py-24 bg-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-16"><div class="inline-block bg-orange-100 text-[#F97316] text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-4">Why choose us</div><h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-[#0D1B40] mb-4">Built for Kenyan households</h2><p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">Running out of gas mid-cooking is an emergency. MobiGas solves it — fast, and you pay on delivery.</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-yellow-500 bg-yellow-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.