><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-orange-500 bg-orange-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#0D1B40] text-lg mb-2">Verified vendors only</h3><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every vendor is verified by our team before going live. Rated by customers after every delivery.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-purple-500 bg-purple-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smartphone" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#0D1B40] text-lg mb-2">Pay on delivery</h3><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Pay with cash or M-Pesa when your gas arrives. No upfront payment needed.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-indigo-500 bg-indigo-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#0D1B40] text-lg mb-2">Transparent pricing</h3><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compare vendor prices before you order. No hidden fees, no surprises.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="for-vendors" class="py-24 bg-[#0D1B40] relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-[#F97316]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center"><div><div class="inline-block bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-300 text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-6">For gas vendors</div><h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-white mb-6 leading-tight">Deliver gas.<br><span class="text-[#F97316]">Get paid instantly.</span></h2><p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">Join MobiGas as a vendor and get new customers delivered to you. Get paid on every delivery, access stock boost financing to grow, and protect your stock with theft and fire insurance.</p><div class="space-y-4 mb-10"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[#F97316]/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-banknote text-[#F97316]" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="12" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle><path d="M6 12h.01M18 12h.01"></path></svg></div><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">Get paid instantly after the customer confirms delivery</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[#F97316]/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users text-[#F97316]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">New customers from the platform — no marketing needed</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[#F97316]/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up text-[#F97316]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">Stock boost financing from partner banks to grow your inventory</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[#F97316]/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield text-[#F97316]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C